OL,3,GNEWSACity parking officers to wear body
OL,4,Acameras
OL,5,
OL,6,FParking officers in Hull will wear body
OL,7,Fcameras after a trial found it helped
OL,8,Fdeter attacks.
OL,10,FFrom 28 September, all of the Hull City
OL,11,FCouncil's civil enforcement officers
OL,12,Fwill start using the cameras as part of
OL,13,Ftheir daily duties.
OL,15,FIt comes after a five-month trial
OL,16,Flaunched last year following several
OL,17,Fincidents of aggressive behaviour
OL,18,Ftowards enforcement officers.
OL,23,APub: 15-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,385,380,200,160,0,100
